    "record_id": "kb_cf96f5c7",
    "title": "sample_conflicting_policy.txt",
    "content": "SYNTHETIC TEST DATA \u2014 NOT ASSESSMENT BUSINESS DATA\n\nSource A \u2014 Business Loan Policy v1.0\n\nThe minimum monthly revenue for Starter loans is $500,000.\nMaximum loan amount: $2,000,000.\nProcessing time: 5 business days.\nInterest rate: 12.5% per annum.\n\n---\n\nSource B \u2014 Business Loan Policy v2.0\n\nThe minimum monthly revenue for Starter loans is $750,000.\nMaximum loan amount: $3,000,000.\nProcessing time: 7 business days.\nInterest rate: 11.0% per annum.\n\nNOTE: These sources intentionally contain conflicting values\nto test conflict detection. The pipeline should FLAG these\nconflicts, not decide which is correct.",
