    "title": "What is the processing time?",
    "content": "What is the processing time?\n\nStandard processing takes 5-7 business days. For amounts over $10,000,000, additional review may extend processing to 14 business days.\n\nDocument | Required | Format\n----------------------------\nBusiness Registration | Yes | PDF or original\nFinancial Statements | Yes | Audited preferred\nBank Statements | Yes | Last 6 months\nGovernment ID | Yes | Valid, unexpired",
